{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01497","headline":"舞曲歌辞 冬白紵歌 · 元稹","name":"舞曲歌辞 冬白紵歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"吴宫夜长宫漏款，帘幕四垂灯焰暖。\n西施自舞王自管，雪紵翻翻鹤翎散。\n促节牵繁舞腰嬾，舞腰嬾，王罢饮。\n盖覆西施凤花锦，身作匡牀臂爲枕。\n朝佩摐摐王晏寝，酒醒阍报门无事。\n子胥死後言爲讳，近王之臣谕王意。\n共笑越王穷惴惴，夜夜抱冰寒不睡。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01497.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01497","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}